## CustomerListUploadsApi

### Create customer list upload
## Create customer list upload
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/customer_lists/{{customer_list_id}}/uploads
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "operation": "<string>",
 "total_parts": "<number>"
}


### Get customer list upload
## Get customer list upload
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/customer_lists/{{customer_list_id}}/uploads/{{customer_list_upload_id}}
Accept: application/json

### Run customer list upload
## Run customer list upload
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/customer_lists/{{customer_list_id}}/uploads/{{customer_list_upload_id}}/run
Accept: application/json
